2026-09-27T18:23:08Z","thinking":"**Prioritizing Specific Tools**\n\nI'm zeroing in on the best method for modifying `styles.css`. My current thinking is centered around using the most precise tool for the job. Specifically, I'm leaning heavily on `replace_file_content` to execute the necessary edits to `styles.css`. I'm starting here to keep the thought process straightforward and effective.\n\n\n**Implementing Background Image**\n\nI've decided to incorporate the uploaded image as the website's background. I'm opting to use the relative path `url('.user_uploaded/media_1790533359443.png')` within the `styles.css` file for simplicity. I'll insert this directly within the `body` selector to set the background. I'll also configure `background-size: cover;` and `background-position: center;` to ensure optimal display. The goal is to make these edits to the `styles.css`.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Update CSS for sunset background and glassmorphism","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":":root {\n  /* Color palette tailored for sunset background */\n  --text-main: #FFFFFF;\n  --text-secondary: #E0E0E0;\n  --accent: #FFB74D; /* Orange/sunset accent */\n  --glass-bg: rgba(20, 15, 25, 0.4); /* Darker glass for contrast */\n  --glass-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n  --glass-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n}\n\n/* Global Reset */\n* { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }\nbody { \n  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; \n  background-image: url('.user_uploaded/media_1790533359443.png');\n  background-size: cover;\n  background-position: center;\n  background-attachment: fixed;\n  background-repeat: no-repeat;\n  color: var(--text-main); \n  line-height: 1.6; \n  overflow-x: hidden; \n}\na { color:inherit; text-decoration:none; }\n\n/* Header */\n.site-header { \n  position: sticky; \n  top: 0; \n  background: var(--glass-bg); \n  backdrop-filter: blur(12px); \n  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n  z-index: 1000; \n  display: flex; \n  justify-content: center; \n  padding: 1rem; \n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);\n}\n.logo-wrapper { text-align:center; }\n.logo { max-height: 100px; filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5)); }\n\n/* Main Content */\n.main-content {\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 3rem auto;\n  padding: 0 2rem;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 4rem;\n}\n\n/* App Sections */\n.app-section {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 2rem;\n  align-items: center;\n  background: var(--glass-bg);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n  padding: 3rem;\n  border-radius: 20px;\n  box-shadow: 0 10px 40px var(--glass-shadow);\n  border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);\n  transition: transform 0.3s ease;\n}\n\n.app-section:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-5px);\n}\n\n.app-info {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 1.5rem;\n}\n\n.app-logo {\n  max-width: 300px;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: auto;\n  border-radius: 24px;\n  box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n  transition: transform 0.3s;\n}\n\n.app-logo:hover {\n  transform: scale(1.03);\n}\n\n.app-description {\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  text-align: center;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  margin: 0 1rem;\n  text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n}\n\n.play-button {\n  display: inline-block;\n  transition: transform 0.3s;\n  filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.3));\n}\n\n.play-button img {\n  height: 65px;\n}\n\n.play-button:hover {\n  transform: scale(1.05);\n}\n\n.privacy-link {\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  text-decoration: underline;\n  transition: opacity 0.3s, color 0.3s;\n  margin-top: -0.5rem;\n  text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n}\n\n.privacy-link:hover {\n  color: var(--accent);\n  opacity: 1;\n}\n\n/* Sliders */\n.app-screenshots {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n\n.slider {\n  position: relative;\n  width: 250px;\n  height: 520px;\n  border-radius: 35px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);\n  border: 8px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n  background: #000;\n}\n\n.slide {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  opacity: 0;\n  transition: opacity 0.8s ease-in-out, transform 5s linear;\n}\n\n.slide.active {\n  opacity: 1;\n  transform: scale(1.05);\n}\n\n.slider-btn {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 50%;\n  transform: translateY(-50%);\n  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n  color: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n  width: 36px;\n  height: 36px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  transition: background 0.3s, transform 0.3s, opacity 0.3s;\n  z-index: 10;\n  opacity: 0;\n  backdrop-filter: blur(4px);\n}\n\n.slider:hover .slider-btn {\n  opacity: 1;\n}\n\n.slider-btn:hover {\n  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);\n  transform: translateY(-50%) scale(1.1);\n}\n\n.prev-btn { left: 10px; }\n.next-btn { right: 10px; }\n\n/* Privacy Policy Pages specific styles */\n.privacy-content {\n  max-width: 800px;\n  margin: 4rem auto;\n  padding: 3rem;\n  background: var(--glass-bg);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(15px);\n  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(15px);\n  border-radius: 20px;\n  box-shadow: 0 10px 40px var(--glass-shadow);\n  border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);\n}\n\n.privacy-content h1, .privacy-content h2 {\n  color: var(--accent);\n  text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n}\n\n.privacy-content a {\n  color: var(--accent);\n  text-decoration: underline;\n}\n\n.back-btn {\n  display: inline-block;\n  margin-bottom: 2rem;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  font-weight: 600;\n  text-decoration: underline;\n  transition: color 0.3s;\n}\n\n.back-btn:hover {\n  color: var(--text-main);\n}\n\n/* Footer */\n.site-footer { \n  text-align: center; \n  padding: 2rem; \n  margin-top: 3rem; \n  font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; \n  color: var(--text-secondary); \n  font-weight: 600;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--glass-border);\n  background: var(--glass-bg);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n}\n\n/* Reveal animation */\n.reveal { opacity:0; transform:translateY(30px); transition:opacity 0.8s ease-out, transform 0.8s ease-out; }\n.reveal.active { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); }\n\n/* Responsive layout */\n@media (max-width: 900px) {\n  .app-section {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    gap: 3rem;\n    padding: 2rem;\n  }\n  \n  .app-section .app-info { order: 1; }\n  .app-section .app-screenshots { order: 2; }\n  \n  .slider {\n    width: 220px;\n    height: 460px;\n  }\n  \n  .slider-btn { opacity: 1; }\n}","Description":"Overwrite CSS to use the sunset image as background and apply a dark glassmorphism theme","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\gentl\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\76ac267d-6234-40b8-94af-70000458ea9e\\styles.css","toolAction":"Overwrite CSS file","toolSummary":"File edit"}}]}
